  "description": "A special membership to the Erebos Hotel, inherited from his mother, who passed away ten years ago. Jess, who wanted to draw the monsters that appeared in his dreams, enters the hotel with high hopes. However, amid bizarre rules and a series of disappearances, the hotel gradually descends into a labyrinth. Amid the chaos, Jess finds himself helplessly drawn to Caiman, a man who is both kind and dangerous.\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
